# Internal remediation notes. These stay on disk and stay useful locally; they
# are not published. They were never public — they first appeared on an unmerged
# branch — and untracking them also closes a defect the release gate would have
# had as a public document: it cites measurement artifacts that live outside this
# repository, so every ticked box would have pointed an external reader at a file
# they cannot open.
docs/
